This repository does NOT redistribute that database, nor any portion of it. The
raw records live only in a local, git-ignored directory (data/raw/) and are
obtained by the user directly from PhysioNet. The .gitignore file in this
repository enforces that exclusion deliberately.

The small artifacts committed under data/fixtures/ are either generated by
scripts contained in this repository (data/fixtures/models/) or derived from the
project's own signal-processing outputs (data/fixtures/reference/). Provenance
for each is documented in the README.md alongside the artifacts.

